%% AI Ecosystem — AI Application & Agent Runtime
%% v5: flattened logical topology with no grouping containers or category-label nodes.
%% Every visible arrow terminates on a canonical component node.

classDef user fill:#f7f7f7,stroke:#555,color:#111,stroke-width:1px;
classDef app fill:#eef4ff,stroke:#4a6fa5,color:#111,stroke-width:1px;
